<!--
  The themed-icon layer, on the adaptive icon's own 108dp canvas so it lines up with the
  colour layers exactly.

  Only the alpha of this drawable is used: the launcher paints it in whatever colour the
  wallpaper theme calls for. Pointing that at the colour foreground, as this used to, silhouettes
  the cream dot along with the stroke and leaves a bump at the trough where the dot is wider
  than the stroke. The mark is drawn as its own stroke here instead, which also makes it a
  vector rather than a single-density raster.

  The stroke is the same one ic_launcher_foreground.xml draws; keep the two in step.
-->
